{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "51", "x": 0.9076798674721437, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.026063381131492046, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 7-13", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15360198182160828, "w": 0.15931760108422188, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Do the following statements agree with the information given in Reading Passage 1?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.18386064948090083, "w": 0.8320992148331463, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "TRUE", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21411924169740834, "w": 0.06576173528815613, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "if the statement agrees with the information", "x": 0.22821339605399907, "y": 0.21411924169740834, "w": 0.4540739213118929, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "FALSE", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24437783391391585, "w": 0.07603520983731032, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "if the statement contradicts the information", "x": 0.2886850744069726, "y": 0.24437783391391585, "w": 0.4561400554434445, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "NOT GIVEN", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.12703298012461497, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "if there is no information on this", "x": 0.2886850744069726, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.3321226930475676, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "7.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33504246448040514, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "West Indian manatees can be found in a variety of different aquatic habitats.", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.33504246448040514, "w": 0.766386665891578, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "8.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3633728145545428, "w": 0.026612376627878402, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "The Florida manatee lives in warmer waters than the Antillean manatee.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3633728145545428, "w": 0.7330936479332045, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "9.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.39170316462868043, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "The African manatee's range is limited to coastal waters between the West", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.39170316462868043, "w": 0.7784885192044104, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "African countries of Mauritania and Angola.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.42003355242421053, "w": 0.44681060503768666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "10 The extent of the loss of Amazonian manatees in the mid-twentieth century", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4483639402197407, "w": 0.8267021987399068, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "was only revealed many years later.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.47671903552736544, "w": 0.3675927002437941, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "11 It is predicted that West Indian manatee populations will fall in the coming", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.505049385601503, "w": 0.8259506908285175, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "decades.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5332314528816805, "w": 0.09599084626454944, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "12 The risk to manatees from entanglement and plastic consumption increased", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5615618029558181, "w": 0.8267634061373282, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "significantly in the period 2009-2020.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5898921907513482, "w": 0.38754836230227163, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "13 There is some legislation in place which aims to reduce the likelihood of boat", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6182225408254859, "w": 0.8263642764921661, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "strikes on manatees in Florida.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6465529663424086, "w": 0.31454562273298103, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}